  es: ['Motorway tolls on some routes', 'Blood alcohol limit 0.5 g/l (0.3 for new riders)',
       'Out-of-town 90 km/h, motorway 120 km/h'],
  gb: ['No vignette; a few tolled bridges and the London zones',
       'Blood alcohol limit 0.8 g/l (0.5 in Scotland)', 'Ride on the left',
       'National speed limit 60 mph out of town, 70 mph motorway'],
  no: ['Automatic road tolls - register a payment method online before the trip',
       'Blood alcohol limit 0.2 g/l - effectively zero', 'Headlight on at all times',
       'Out-of-town 80 km/h; speed fines are among the highest in Europe'],
